		</TRID_INFO>
		<TRIO_INFO>
			<TRAN name="obpds_srvc_313r" title="HTS계좌연결 등록계좌 조회" realdata="0" dessvr="9" >
				<TRBLOCK name="InBlock1" inout="in" _len="195" _ulen="147" >

CSNO^고객번호^10^0^0^0^0^0^0
ELFN_ID^전자금융ID^20^0^0^0^0^0^0
SVCD^서비스코드^3^0^0^0^0^0^0
SVC_SRNO^서비스일련번호^11^0^7^0^0^0^0
